msgctxt "80"
msgid ""
"I... I won't let anybody take my mew-mew away! I'll protect you, Snuggles!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "92"
msgid ""
"I'm not trying to take anyone. Your cat was hanging out near that bar over "
"there. Maybe it got out on its own."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "104"
msgid "Huh...? Is that really what happened?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "116"
msgid "Meow."
msgstr "Miao."

msgctxt "128"
msgid ""
"Sorry for the trouble, buddy. It's just that my cat's such a\r\n"
"cute widdle cuddlebug, I couldn't rule out a kidnapping,\r\n"
"ya know?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "140"
msgid ""
"Take this as an apology. You look like a fellow cat lover,\r\n"
"so it oughta do ya some good."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "152"
msgid "You got a <Color:8>Catnip Stick<Color:Default>."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "176"
msgid "Well, have a good one."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "200"
msgid ""
"(So that was the Devil Cat... Looks like it really does\r\n"
"bring people bad luck.)"
msgstr ""

